61
00:03:14.512 --> 00:03:17.795
Kata miring di sini berarti kemiringan garis,

62
00:03:17.795 --> 00:03:19.841
bukan panjang sisi miring.

63
00:03:20.493 --> 00:03:22.168
Bentuk segitiganya mungkin

64
00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.508
