74
00:03:53.605 --> 00:03:54.955
Akarnya 5.

75
00:03:55.323 --> 00:03:57.528
Jadi panjangnya 5 sentimeter.

76
00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:01.607
Kalau ditanya kemiringan, hitungannya 3 dibagi 4.

77
00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.092
Hasilnya 0,75.

78
00:04:04.452 --> 00:04:08.375
