103
00:05:24.892 --> 00:05:30.604
Tambahannya 86 dikurangi 64, yaitu 22.

104
00:05:31.069 --> 00:05:34.598
Dibagi 2 jam, hasilnya 11 barang per jam.

105
00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.101
