108
00:05:42.888 --> 00:05:45.058
Jumlah tiap jam bisa berbeda.

109
00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:47.728
Rata-rata merangkum 1 rentang.

110
00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.027
